### ====================================================================
### HESTA Smart Home - Máy Bơm Nước (Water Pump / Motor) Test Suite
### ====================================================================
### Cấu hình thiết bị theo ESP32 Fan_Motor.ino:
### - Node ID:   664017ce-c045-4b0e-9a26-f9f95f996803
### - Device ID: f0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000105
### - MQTT Topics:
###   + Lệnh (Subscribe):     hesta/nodes/{{nodeId}}/devices/{{deviceId}}/command
###   + Trạng thái (Publish): hesta/nodes/{{nodeId}}/devices/{{deviceId}}/state
###   + Xác nhận (ACK):       hesta/nodes/{{nodeId}}/devices/{{deviceId}}/ack
### ====================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@deviceId = 664017ce-c045-4b0e-9a26-f9f95f996803
@nodeId = 664017ce-c045-4b0e-9a26-f9f95f996803
@token = 

### ====================================================================
### 0. (Tùy chọn) Đăng nhập để lấy JWT Bearer Token nếu bật Security
### ====================================================================
#POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
#Content-Type: application/json
#
#{
#  "email": "test_user@hesta.com",
#  "password": "Password123!"
#}
#
#> {%
#    if (response.body && response.body.result && response.body.result.accessToken) {
#        client.global.set("token", response.body.result.accessToken);
#    }
#%}

### ====================================================================
### 0.1 Xem thông tin & trạng thái hiện tại của Máy Bơm Nước
### ====================================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}
#Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ====================================================================
### 1. BẬT MÁY BƠM NƯỚC (Action: TURN_ON)
### ====================================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/command
Content-Type: application/json
#Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "action": "TURN_ON",
  "nodeId": "{{nodeId}}"
}

### ====================================================================
### 2. TẮT MÁY BƠM NƯỚC (Action: TURN_OFF)
### ====================================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/command
Content-Type: application/json
#Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "action": "TURN_OFF",
  "nodeId": "{{nodeId}}"
}

### ====================================================================
### 3. BẬT MÁY BƠM NƯỚC (Action: POWER_ON)
### ====================================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/command
Content-Type: application/json
#Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "action": "POWER_ON",
  "nodeId": "{{nodeId}}"
}

### ====================================================================
### 4. TẮT MÁY BƠM NƯỚC (Action: POWER_OFF)
### ====================================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/command
Content-Type: application/json
#Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "action": "POWER_OFF",
  "nodeId": "{{nodeId}}"
}

### ====================================================================
### 5. CÀI ĐẶT NGUỒN MÁY BƠM (SET_POWER: power = true)
### ====================================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/command
Content-Type: application/json
#Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "action": "SET_POWER",
  "power": true,
  "nodeId": "{{nodeId}}"
}

### ====================================================================
### 6. CÀI ĐẶT NGUỒN MÁY BƠM (SET_POWER: power = false)
### ====================================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/command
Content-Type: application/json
#Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "action": "SET_POWER",
  "power": false,
  "nodeId": "{{nodeId}}"
}

### ====================================================================
### 7. LỆNH BẬT MOTOR RIÊNG BIỆT (Action: MOTOR_ON)
### ====================================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/command
Content-Type: application/json
#Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "action": "MOTOR_ON",
  "nodeId": "{{nodeId}}"
}

### ====================================================================
### 8. LỆNH TẮT MOTOR RIÊNG BIỆT (Action: MOTOR_OFF)
### ====================================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/command
Content-Type: application/json
#Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "action": "MOTOR_OFF",
  "nodeId": "{{nodeId}}"
}

### ====================================================================
### 9. GỬI LỆNH TRỰC TIẾP QUA TARGET (target: "motor", power: true)
### ====================================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/command
Content-Type: application/json
#Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "target": "motor",
  "power": true,
  "nodeId": "{{nodeId}}"
}

### ====================================================================
### 10. BẬT ĐỒNG THỜI CẢ QUẠT VÀ MÁY BƠM (Action: ALL_ON)
### ====================================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/command
Content-Type: application/json
#Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "action": "ALL_ON",
  "nodeId": "{{nodeId}}"
}

### ====================================================================
### 11. TẮT ĐỒNG THỜI CẢ QUẠT VÀ MÁY BƠM (Action: ALL_OFF)
### ====================================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/command
Content-Type: application/json
#Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "action": "ALL_OFF",
  "nodeId": "{{nodeId}}"
}

### ====================================================================
### 12. LỊCH SỬ THAY ĐỔI TRẠNG THÁI CỦA MÁY BƠM NƯỚC
### ====================================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/history
#Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
